# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
config TA1618_THM1_THERMAL
	bool "Nokia TA-1618 THM1 temperature sensor"
	depends on MACH_NOKIA_TA1618
	depends on THERMAL
	depends on OF
	depends on MFD_SYSCON
	depends on HAS_IOMEM
	help
	  Read the calibrated UMS9117 THM1 sensor0 temperature on the Nokia
	  3210 4G TA-1618 through a tripless thermal zone. The driver does not
	  configure thermal trips, polling, interrupts or cooling devices.

	  The calibration is read once from the UMS9117 eFuse controller during
	  probe. The driver does not write eFuse data, thermal thresholds or
	  interrupt configuration.
